  "_comment": "Torch public entry points no maintained run exercised, and the ones the coverage wrapper cannot reach. Regenerate with tools/api_coverage_ratchet.py --surface torch --update. This set may only shrink; adding a public API without a test grows it and fails the ratchet.",
  "_produced_by": "JITTOR_TORCH_SHIM=1 JITTOR_API_COVERAGE=1 JITTOR_API_COVERAGE_REPORT=<path> python -m pytest <torch gate selection>",
  "_surface": "torch",
  "_taken_with": "one process could not run the whole selection, so it was taken in parts and merged. Excluded: adapters/tests/vllm (needs the jittor_adapters distribution installed), the 14 files in api_coverage.IDENTITY_CONTRACT_FILES (the wrapper is visible to their identity assertions, KI-TEST-003), the three compat/tests/torch/test_torch_hf_*.py files and the tests/ops/test_ops.py cases matching scatter_add or interpolate (each terminates the interpreter on this build, KI-OPS-009/KI-TEST-002). Taken at 65a220d53 on a CPU-only build (nvcc_path=\"\"), JITTOR_TEST_DEVICES=cpu, one part per top-level selection path. The set is therefore looser than a complete session would produce; re-taking it once those run can only shrink it.",
